## Original Content
Presidente da SAD considera que os "três grandes" já esgotaram a capacidade de crescimento dentro de Portugal. Ainda, 10 dos 16 feridos em atropelamento em Albufeira já tiveram alta hospitalar.

## Summary
Estrela da Amadora sold 90% of its SAD to a German group, while the SAD president commented on the limited growth of Portugal's 'big three' football clubs. In a separate incident, 10 out of 16 people injured in a hit-and-run in Albufeira have been discharged from the hospital.

## Key Points
- Estrela da Amadora sold 90% of its SAD to a German group.
- The president of SAD believes the 'big three' in Portuguese football have exhausted growth potential within Portugal.
- 10 of the 16 injured individuals in the Albufeira hit-and-run incident have been discharged from the hospital.


